sentences.text:
The case of the claimants is that on 20.09.2015 at about 08.00 a.m. near Teeya Marathukadu on the Nadur to Velur road of Yercaurd,
while the deceased 1st claimant riding his two wheeler bearing Regn. No. TN-27 P-8096 in Nadur to Velur Road, the driver of respondent Transport Corporation bus bearing Regn. No. TN-30 N- 0130 drove it in a rash and negligent manner without any signal or sound in the opposite direction,
dashed the petitioner's two wheeler and caused an accident.
